{"title": "Water pump", "pageid": 58980, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Water_pump", "categories": [], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">      </p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Water pump risen road toll house.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png/219px-Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png/219px-Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png.webp 1x, /w/images/c/ce/Water_pump_risen_road_toll_house.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Water pump risen road toll house.png\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure></aside>\nA <b>Water Pump</b> is a kind of environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. They can be found in several places during the adventure. Interacting with water pumps creates a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a> surface.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Localisations\">Localisations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road\" title=\"The Risen Road\">The Risen Road</a>:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;114&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;550</span> Inside the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road#Toll_House\" title=\"The Risen Road\">Toll House</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a>:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-91&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;598</span> On the ground floor of the house where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mirileth\" title=\"Mirileth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/30px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/45px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/60px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirileth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png/30px-Portrait_Mirileth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Portrait_Mirileth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mirileth\" title=\"Mirileth\">Mirileth</a>, the wife of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Benryn\" title=\"Benryn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/30px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/45px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/60px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Benryn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png/30px-Portrait_Benryn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Portrait_Benryn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Benryn\" title=\"Benryn\">Benryn</a>, is</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-44&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;624</span> In the kitchen of the main building</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Although water surfaces of increasing size are created when a party member interacts with a water pump, there is no way to fill a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bucket\" title=\"Bucket\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Clutter_Bucket_Wooden_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bucket\" title=\"Bucket\">Bucket</a></span> and change it into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bucket_of_Water\" title=\"Bucket of Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Bucket_of_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bucket_of_Water\" title=\"Bucket of Water\">Bucket of Water</a></span>, or create <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water\" title=\"Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Water\" title=\"Water\">Water bottles</a></span>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715115626\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.103 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4904/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41559/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16488/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parse